12
00:01:05.097 --> 00:01:08.464
Healthy. Say it with me. Healthy!

13
00:01:11.964 --> 00:01:22.267
Good hydration keeps my body working well. When I sweat on a hot day, I lose water, so I drink more from my bottle. Pale yellow urine is a sign I am drinking enough.

14
