I can do that too!

15
00:01:24.932 --> 00:01:29.848
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:29.898 --> 00:01:31.048
Thirst!

17
00:01:31.822 --> 00:01:36.979
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:37.029 --> 00:01:38.179
Bottle!

19
00:01:39.087 --> 00:01:43.683
Did you know? Your brain works better when you drink enough water!

20
00:01:43.733 --> 00:01:45.709
